{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslistitemavatar"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An avatar element that can be used at the leading or trailing position of a list item"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSListItemAvatar"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" displays a circular visual identifier that can represent a user, a contact,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or any entity. It supports three content types: a predefined icon, a custom image, or text initials."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"An optional "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeIcon","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" can be attached at the bottom-trailing corner to indicate status."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Avatar-types","text":"Avatar types","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar\/AvatarType","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the content displayed inside the avatar:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".icon","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined person\/people icon from the current theme’s resource bundle."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".image(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A custom "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Image"},{"type":"text","text":" asset that fills the avatar circle."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".initials(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A short text string (2 characters maximum) rendered centered in the avatar."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Sizes","text":"Sizes","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar\/Size","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available sizes for the avatar:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".medium","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The default size, suited for standard list items."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".large","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A larger variant for increased visual prominence."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".extraLarge","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": The largest variant, typically used for profile-like displays."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note:"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" When the avatar is embedded in a list item with small size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(via "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/SwiftUICore\/View\/oudsListItemSize(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"), the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"size"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ignored"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the avatar is always rendered at its smallest available size."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Badge","text":"Badge","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional badge "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeIcon","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" can be placed at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bottom-trailing corner of the avatar to convey status information (e.g. online presence, notification count)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The badge is rendered with a safety-area border matching the theme’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"controlItem.colorBadgeSafetyArea"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The recommended badge sizes per avatar size are:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"},{"type":"text","text":" avatar → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".extraSmall"},{"type":"text","text":" badge"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".large"},{"type":"text","text":" avatar → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".small"},{"type":"text","text":" badge"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".extraLarge"},{"type":"text","text":" avatar → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"},{"type":"text","text":" badge"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","level":2},{"code":["    \/\/ Avatar with predefined icon, medium size","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Avatar with a custom image, large size","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .image(Image(\"il_placeholder\")), size: .large)","","    \/\/ Avatar with initials, extra large size","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .initials(\"AB\"), size: .extraLarge)","","    \/\/ Avatar with icon and a notification badge","    let badgeType = .standard(.init(accessibilityLabel: \"Do not disturb\", status: .negative, size: .small))","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium, badgeType: badgeType)","","    \/\/ Avatar with initials and a icon badge with positive status","    let badgeType = .icon(.init(status: .positive, accessibilityLable: \"Online\", size: .small))","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .initials(\"JD\"), size: .large, badgeType: badgeType)","","    \/\/ Usage as leading element in a list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: \"John Doe\", description: \"Online\"),","        leading: .avatar(OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium))","    )","","    \/\/ Usage as trailing element in a list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(","        data: OUDSListItemData(label: .textual(\"Contact\")),","        trailing: .avatar(OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .initials(\"AB\"), size: .medium))","    )"]